@host = http://localhost:5251

### Login admin
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "admin", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Token M2M (client credentials)
# @name client
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=test-client&client_secret=test-secret

### Crear ticket (M2M)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{client.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "No carga el dashboard",
  "description": "Pantalla en blanco al entrar",
  "type": "Bug",
  "priority": "High",
  "tenantId": "t-001",
  "tenantName": "Empresa Demo",
  "reporterUserEmail": "user@demo.com",
  "metadata": { "browser": "Firefox", "version": "1.2.3" }
}

### Listar tickets (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets?status=New&priority=High&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Suscripción WebPush (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/push/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/abc123",
  "keys": { "p256dh": "BNcRdreALRFXTkOOUHK1EtK2wtaz5Ry4YfYCA_0QTpQtUbVlUls0VJXg7A8u-Ts1XbjhazAkj7I99e8QcYP7DkM", "auth": "tBHItJI5svbpez7KI4CCXg" }
}

### Detalle de ticket (admin)
@ticketId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Cambiar estado (admin)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### Sistemas origen (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/system-apps
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
